{{- /*
  validate_specialized.user: prompt for the per-axis specialized
  validators (architecture, scope, security, performance, testing,
  grounding, structural). The DomainName drives the closing verdict
  ("Evaluate ... from a <axis> perspective"), and a few axis/kind
  combinations gate optional sub-blocks:

    - The Grounding axis on phase-plan kind injects a "Prior Phase Context"
      block listing already-shipped prior-phase plans so the critic does
      not flag legitimate prior-phase symbols as missing on master.
    - Roadmap kind injects a "Validation Stage" preface that limits the
      scope of acceptable findings (no per-phase implementation detail).
    - AutomatedVerificationOnly tells the critic not to demand evidence
      matrices for a plan that must stay automated-only.

  The plan body is referenced by path (PlanPath) rather than inlined
  because plans can be large and the validator reads them via tool use.
*/ -}}
